00:31:53.355 --> 00:31:55.273
Get away from him, whore.

00:31:55.481 --> 00:31:57.315
She's not a whore, okay?
She goes to UNLV.

00:31:57.524 --> 00:31:59.775
Oh, you know, I'm sorry. Skank!

00:31:59.984 --> 00:32:01.610
Hello?

00:32:06.154 --> 00:32:08.114
