00:32:44.011 --> 00:32:45.220
...of $5000.

00:32:49.431 --> 00:32:51.724
So, what will it be, gentlemen?

00:32:51.933 --> 00:32:53.642
Cash, check or charge?

00:33:00.188 --> 00:33:02.148
I hate the Vegas.

00:33:02.940 --> 00:33:05.400
My entire life,
I've never even seen a prostitute...

00:33:05.608 --> 00:33:08.360
