advantage of me in my hotel room.

00:33:08.527 --> 00:33:10.486
And not in a nice way.

00:33:10.695 --> 00:33:12.738
- Way to go, whore-boy.
- Thanks.

00:33:12.946 --> 00:33:14.781
All right.
Summer, how much money you got?

00:33:14.989 --> 00:33:17.824
I'm not giving you money.
I'm not the one that was worked on.

00:33:17.991 --> 00:33:20.367
I wasn't worked on. Okay?
I was entrapped.

00:33:20.576 --> 00:33:22.786
This is your fault.
You broke up with me.

00:33:22.994 --> 00:33:25.913
