- What, your dad wouldn't approve?

00:33:26.121 --> 00:33:28.664
- This has nothing to do with my dad.
- Right. It doesn't.

00:33:28.873 --> 00:33:30.791
Okay. So maybe I overreacted a little.

00:33:30.999 --> 00:33:33.250
- Yeah, a little.
- Lf you didn't try so hard with him...

00:33:33.459 --> 00:33:36.044
I only did that because I knew
