happens again, I'll kill you.

00:33:53.263 --> 00:33:56.473
You won't have to. If we don't
get 5000 soon, her pimp will.

00:33:57.307 --> 00:34:00.517
Between my money and Theresa's money,
it's only 3000.

00:34:02.727 --> 00:34:05.979
Three thousand five hundred.

00:34:10.232 --> 00:34:11.941
Thanks...

00:34:12.317 --> 00:34:14.526
...but that still leaves us 1500 short.

00:34:15.193 --> 00:34:17.403
You guys did buy us till midnight.

00:34:17.612 --> 00:34:20.947
That's more than enough time
for another game of no-limit Hold'em.

00:34:22.948 --> 00:34:25.617
That's a card game, not hooker talk.

00:34:29.244 --> 00:34:32.204
Well, that was some performance.

00:34:33.371 --> 00:34:35.790
Believe me...

00:34:35.998 --> 00:34:37.749
...that was nothing.

00:34:38.541 --> 00:34:41.835
- What are you doing after the party?
- Getting married.

00:34:42.585 --> 00:34:44.462
Yeah, but not tonight. Right?

00:34:52.383 --> 00:34:53.551
Let me get my purse.

00:34:58.137 --> 00:35:00.347
- Thanks for the party.
- You're leaving?

00:35:00.555 --> 00:35:04.849
I'm exhausted, and the boys
are getting back from Vegas early, so...

00:35:07.226 --> 00:35:10.311
Please tell me your sister's
not hitting on that poor stripper.

00:35:11.520 --> 00:35:15.940
Oh, they're old friends.
In fact, Hailey set this whole thing up.

00:35:16.148 --> 00:35:18.191
She did? Really?

00:35:19.233 --> 00:35:20.693
Excuse me.

00:35:25.446 --> 00:35:26.988
So, what was the plan, Hailey?

00:35:27.363 --> 00:35:31.908
Get your stripper friend to proposition me,
tell Daddy about it, the wedding's off?

00:35:32.116 --> 00:35:36.161
Please, I know you'd never sleep with
Jeff. He doesn't make enough money.

00:35:37.536 --> 00:35:39.329
What the hell
is that supposed to mean?

00:35:39.871 --> 00:35:42.873
Well, you married Jimmy for his money,
and now my dad.

00:35:43.040 --> 00:35:47.334
You see, Jeffrey here might be a stripper,
but, honey, you're a whore.

00:35:50.711 --> 00:35:53.838
- You're going down, bitch.
- Who are you calling "bitch," bitch?

00:35:54.047 --> 00:35:57.299
Oh, my God. Hailey! Stop it!

00:35:58.258 --> 00:36:00.176
Ladies!

00:36:18.062 --> 00:36:21.481
I never liked you,
even when you were a little twerp!

00:36:22.273 --> 00:36:23.524
Come on!

00:36:25.650 --> 00:36:27.818
Hey, how are you?
I'm meeting someone here.

00:36:29.861 --> 00:36:34.239
Caleb! There you are. I'm so glad
you guys didn't start eating without me.

00:36:34.447 --> 00:36:38.283
Mr. Campbell, how are you? Sandy Cohen.
Caleb's son-in-law. Former partner.

00:36:38.491 --> 00:36:40.367
- How is the food here?
- Filet's excellent.

00:36:40.576 --> 00:36:42.410
- Really?
- Would you care to join us?

00:36:42.619 --> 00:36:44.912
- Actually, we should just...
- Don't mind if I do.

00:36:45.120 --> 00:36:48.789
So I understand that you're interested
in Caleb's Balboa coastline property.

00:36:49.540 --> 00:36:52.834
I can see why. It is the perfect location.

00:36:53.042 --> 00:36:55.960
You mind? I'm parched.

00:36:56.836 --> 00:37:00.964
As a matter of fact, some partners and I
recently tried to open a restaurant there.

00:37:01.172 --> 00:37:05.008
Not unlike this one, except we had
two kinds of meat loaf and dirty martinis.

00:37:05.842 --> 00:37:08.927
The problem was,
we could not get a liquor license...

00:37:09.302 --> 00:37:12.304
...and for the longest time,
we couldn't figure out why.

00:37:12.512 --> 00:37:14.972
- Sandy, this is not the time.
- You gonna eat that?

00:37:15.181 --> 00:37:18.475
Turns out, one of our partners
went behind our backs...

00:37:18.683 --> 00:37:22.519
...to a friend on the city council and
got them to deny us the liquor license.

00:37:22.727 --> 00:37:24.728
So he bought us out,
and now he's peddling...

00:37:24.937 --> 00:37:28.856
...that piece of property
at a much higher price to someone else.

00:37:29.064 --> 00:37:32.692
- Robert, I have to ask you to excuse us.
- The problem is, the joke's on him.

00:37:33.526 --> 00:37:37.445
Not only is he guilty of collusion
and fraud, but he and his property...

00:37:37.653 --> 00:37:40.488
