feeling pretty confident right now.

00:39:09.294 --> 00:39:10.836
Wouldn't you say?

00:39:14.172 --> 00:39:15.548
You lost on purpose?

00:39:15.756 --> 00:39:17.924
I won a lot of money this afternoon.

00:39:18.508 --> 00:39:20.259
Now I need yours.

00:39:32.517 --> 00:39:34.101
Deal me in.

00:39:36.102 --> 00:39:38.312
