00:40:20.588 --> 00:40:24.216
- I thought that was Tijuana.
- I think that hat should stay in Vegas.

00:40:27.051 --> 00:40:28.343
Sorry.

00:40:38.183 --> 00:40:40.101
Definitely love the Vegas.

00:41:03.490 --> 00:41:05.033
How was Vegas?

00:41:06.492 --> 00:41:08.535
Definitely a spectacle.

00:41:08.743 --> 00:41:10.578
