00:42:15.452 --> 00:42:16.994
What are you talking about?

00:42:18.787 --> 00:42:22.081
You know what,
maybe you should just ask Theresa.

00:42:23.874 --> 00:42:25.750
Just tell me what's going on, okay?

00:42:28.543 --> 00:42:29.919
Theresa's pregnant.

00:42:40.676 --> 00:42:43.011
And it might not be Eddie's.

00:42:43.219 --> 00:42:46.346
So why don't you tell me
what's going on?
